fixture tech11_ember_stops_on_ceiling
doc BUILD.md s6 Ember Toss "stops on walls; press again to teleport to it": an ember stopped on a ceiling; docs/adr/0010 teleport fit
room test/flat
spawn 400 544
frames 90
input
  # Thrown straight up from a full jump's apex, it stops under the ceiling (its underside at 32 u).
  0..20 jump
  21 U jump toss
  70 toss
end
expect
  mark stopped 22..69 ember=1 ember_y<=33u
  at stopped+1 ember_y=ember_y@stopped
  # The body fits under the ceiling: its top on it, 22 u (half its height) below the ember's
  # centre, then it falls.
  at 70 event.teleport=1 ember=0 y>=76u y<=77u invuln=1
  at 71 state=air
end
